39,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm still a bit nervous. I don't have any clues yet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Ryuji. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that's a blatant lie. I am a human. Why would you target me so aggressively?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! A reveal already?! Is Ryuji the Seer? This is getting exciting!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
