50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no reason to lie. The most logical action for the village is to execute the werewolf now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"While I value Ryuji's conviction, I will trust the evidence provided by the Seer's claim.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"This is a mistake. You are all being led by a false claim. Please, think logically!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
